# rami-valida.list — the branches of the outcome validator, VALIDA_PY of plugins/maat/scripts/run-phase.sh and its
# twin `driver.py valida`, and the phases of _phase_of (driver.py), one label per branch (Maat 1.5.0).
# Format: <label><TAB><what>. Every label has at least one jsonl in casi.tsv (tools/esempi-equiv.test.sh); no jsonl of
# the corpus is empty (an empty one exits 0 on both sides and proves nothing).
nessun-result	no «result» event (a session killed): no output
fic-scartato	a «fic_scartato» event after the result (parallel review discarded): no output
is-error	result with is_error: no output
structured-output	structured_output of the result event, valid
recinto-json	the JSON in a ```json fence of the text
v-nojson	no JSON block (v_nojson)
v-badjson	unreadable JSON block (v_badjson)
errori-schema	JSON outside the schema (minimal validator or jsonschema)
v-phase	JSON of another phase (v_phase)
v-dev	declared deviations, not all defensive (v_dev)
v-blocked	bloccato_su other than none/nessuno (v_blocked)
v-esito	esito STOP (v_esito)
v-json-stop	the prose says OK, the JSON stops: STOP — JSON with originale= (v_json_stop)
riga-assente	no result line in the text: composed from the JSON
defensive	deviations all «defensive: »
difensiva	deviations all «difensiva: »
none	bloccato_su «none»
nessuno	bloccato_su «nessuno»
phase-result	result line «PHASE RESULT» (1.3.0)
esito-fase	result line «ESITO FASE» (1.2.x)
fic-corsie	the merged event of the lanes (subtype fic_corsie)
fase-plan	phase plan (label *plan*)
fase-implement	phase implement
fase-review	phase review
fase-fix	phase fix
fase-test-red	phase test-red
fase-test-stage	phase test-stage
fase-probe	phase probe (a label with no known key)
